Azure Cloud Portfolio is a personal portfolio project published publicly
for educational, demonstration, and professional evaluation purposes.

Its primary purpose is to showcase cloud engineering skills, Microsoft Azure
knowledge, technical documentation, cloud architectures, hands-on laboratories,
and practical implementations.

The repository is made available for inspection and review so that recruiters,
employers, and other interested individuals can evaluate the technical
knowledge, practical experience, and skills demonstrated throughout
the project.

